  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0: Initial release. Site-wide SEO & content audit for Umbraco 16, 17 and 18. Crawls every Content & Media URL, checks broken links/images/resources, and audits each page for SEO, Open Graph/Twitter, technical SEO, content quality, accessibility and carbon emissions. Includes a composite SEO score (Lighthouse-style, 0-100), a run health score, grouped issues with severity/priority, orphaned-page and duplicate-content detection, incremental scans, CSV export and a per-page detail modal. Adds a per-node SEO Audit tab in the Content/Media editors (auto-scans on open). Runs as a recurring background job (auto-discovered by uTPro Job Monitor). Built on the framework-agnostic T4VN.Seo.Core engine. Config key: uTPro:Feature:SEOAudit.",
